    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that but it doesn't change the reality. my bills are piling up, i'm always exhausted, and i can see the look in my kid's eyes like they're waiting for me to fix things and i just can't. it's like i'm just a constant source of stress for them. if i wasn't here, at least they wouldn't have to deal with my mess anymore.",
